    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal in Harbor is to survive. In the breathtaking atmosphere of post-apocalyptic anarchy, you must gain access to limited resources and protect everything you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face more than just hunger and thirst! You can form alliances, build shelters, and trade with others. In this open world, everything is out to get you. No democracy, no rules\u2014there\u2019s only one safe zone: HARBOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the items around you to survive and explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the resources you gather, you\u2019ll be able to craft tools, weapons, clothing, and other essential items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most critical things in the game are Clean Blood and Fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the Harbor zone to take on missions, trade resources, and ensure your character\u2019s temporary safety within the secure zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A War Truck and a Train can provide these valuable resources, but don\u2019t forget\u2014you\u2019ll need vehicles to catch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure yourself by building shelters and defending your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means losing everything you\u2019ve worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing left to do is trust no one and just survive. Everything is out to see you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/0fd45a80bd1edf2112627ca0ab65eb08.avif?t=1755090463\" width=643 height=188 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal in Harbor is to survive. In the breathtaking atmosphere of post-apocalyptic anarchy, you must gain access to limited resources and protect everything you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face more than just hunger and thirst! You can form alliances, build shelters, and trade with others. In this open world, everything is out to get you. No democracy, no rules\u2014there\u2019s only one safe zone: HARBOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the items around you to survive and explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the resources you gather, you\u2019ll be able to craft tools, weapons, clothing, and other essential items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most critical things in the game are Clean Blood and Fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/92e5ee127e65b6d30b96b97c64faa4e3.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the Harbor zone to take on missions, trade resources, and ensure your character\u2019s temporary safety within the secure zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A War Truck and a Train can provide these valuable resources, but don\u2019t forget\u2014you\u2019ll need vehicles to catch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure yourself by building shelters and defending your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means losing everything you\u2019ve worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.poster.avif?t=1755090463\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.webm?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.mp4?t=1755090463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing left to do is trust no one and just survive. Everything is out to see you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/0fd45a80bd1edf2112627ca0ab65eb08.avif?t=1755090463\" width=643 height=188 /></span></p>",
